e/aW1nLzEyNDQ3NjQ2LnBuZw==/157x125%23c/xjk%2Ffb.png" alt="Cool Kid Cody: Season 1" style="background: #000000" width="157"/></div><div style="--card_rot: 7.5deg; --card_drop: 9px; --card_z: 6" class="fan_card overflow_card"><img height="125" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMTc2MTQxLnBuZw==/157x125%23c/ZZEy%2BJ.png" alt="A Dream About Parking Lots" style="background: #000000" width="157"/></div><div style="--card_rot: 12.5deg; --card_drop: 25px; --card_z: 7" class="fan_card overflow_card"><img height="125" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2NjM1OTQ3LnBuZw==/157x125%23c/WqXbH%2B.png" alt="Atomic Owl" style="background: #7102f4" width="157"/></div><div style="--card_rot: 17.5deg; --card_drop: 49px; --card_z: 8" class="fan_card"><div class="more_games_tile"><span>And 120 more!</span></div></div></a></div><div class="links_container"><div class="offer_duration"><div class="duration_label">Offer ends in</div><div id="countdown_2858289" class="countdown_widget base_widget"><div class="index_countdown_widget countdown"><div class="time_block"><div class="block_value">3</div> <div class="block_label">days</div> </div><div class="time_block"><div class="block_value">10</div> <div class="block_label">hours</div> </div><div class="time_block"><div class="block_value">46</div> <div class="block_label">minutes</div> </div></div></div></div><a class="cta" href="/b/3802/game-industry-hardship-fund">Get the bundle</a><div class="bundle_summary"><span>127 items for $10 · Regularly <span class="regular_price">$1,021.08</span></span><span class="price_label">Save 99%!</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="blog_post_carousel game_section"><div class="section_header"><h2>From the blog</h2></div><ul><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/updates/itch-app-bundle-support-launch-args-and-more"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4OTYwMzQ4LmpwZw==/300x168%23c/w7aAbx.jpg"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/updates/itch-app-bundle-support-launch-args-and-more">itch app bundle support, launch args, and more</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Edit: We pushed out a hotfix v26.18.0 to address a MacOS crashing issue. You may need to reinstall the app from the setu...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/blog/1572473/itchio-changelog-sale-explorer-bundle-hosting-revamp-jam-theme-editor-patreon-integration-more"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MjUwMjA5LmpwZw==/300x168%23c/fYJ8vE.jpg"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/blog/1572473/itchio-changelog-sale-explorer-bundle-hosting-revamp-jam-theme-editor-patreon-integration-more">itch.io changelog: Sale Explorer, Bundle Hosting revamp, Jam Theme Editor, Patreon integration &amp; more</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Hello everyone, welcome back to the itch.io changelog. In our changelog blog posts we hope to recap some of the feature...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/blog/1564191/the-itchio-summer-sale-2026-is-live"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MDg4ODM5LmpwZw==/300x168%23c/iiCqpg.jpg"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/blog/1564191/the-itchio-summer-sale-2026-is-live">The itch.io Summer Sale 2026 is live!</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Summer is here, and so is the itch.io Summer Sale! Creators across the site have put discounts on thousands of games, ga...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/updates/pushing-builds-with-butler-is-now-in-the-itch-app"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3MzQxMzk0LnBuZw==/300x168%23c/cYr0VI.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/updates/pushing-builds-with-butler-is-now-in-the-itch-app">Pushing builds with butler is now in the itch app</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">The itch.io app has recently gotten a major upgrade for developers: You can now upload with butler directly in the app w...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/updates/ameyega-mode"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2NDYyNDEzLnBuZw==/300x168%23c/Rdd2Nr.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/updates/ameyega-mode">Ameyega Mode</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Ameyega mode is now over, thanks everyone. If you missed it, you can visit this URL when logged in to see it: https://it...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/updates/what-is-creator-day"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0MzA0NjUwLnBuZw==/300x168%23c/xSebB1.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/updates/what-is-creator-day">What is Creator Day?</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Creator Day is a special 24-hour event where itch.io waives its platform fee on all sales across the site. During Creato...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/blog/1124058/creator-day-black-friday-sales-this-friday"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0MjY2NjMwLnBuZw==/300x168%23c/qJZYNA.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/blog/1124058/creator-day-black-friday-sales-this-friday">Creator Day &amp; Black Friday Sales this Friday!</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Creator Day returns this Friday November 28th! From 8am to 8am UTC (midnight to midnight Pacific) on Friday, we’re wai...</span></div></li><li><div><a class="post_link" href="/blog/1096153/the-itchio-halloween-sale-2025-is-live"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzODE4MjI3LnBuZw==/300x168%23c/ZGc%2B2r.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/blog/1096153/the-itchio-halloween-sale-2025-is-live">The itch.io Halloween Sale 2025 is live!</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">The shadows are growing